    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The Tsuchigumo clan is a clan known for their powerful and often forbidden jutsu. They were once a prominent force, though their numbers have dwindled. They possess a deep knowledge of secret techniques, making them both respected and feared.</p><p><b>Source:</b> Mechanics/Character_Options/Occupations/Homebrew/Tsuchigumo Clan.md</p><p><b>Category:</b> Homebrew</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> Age 8+</p><p><b>Class Skills:</b> Select 2 from Chakra Control, Fuinjutsu, Knowledge (ninja lore), Ninjutsu, Survival.</p><p><b>Feat:</b> Select one from Advanced Study, Sealweaver, Genin, Genius Ninja, Ninjutsu Adept.</p><p><b>Wealth Bonus Increase:</b> +1</p><p><b>Reputation Bonus Increase:</b> +1</p><p><b>Affiliation:</b> You require 1 less success to learn Tsuchigumo Hijutsu techniques.</p>"
